    },
    {
      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use Hành lý của tôi chưa tới as your first sentence at the carousel or baggage desk. Pause after it so staff can ask for the baggage tag, flight number, passport, or the counter you should visit. If you have the tag in your hand, point to it right after the phrase.",
      "phrases": [
        {
          "id": "airport-6",
          "vietnamese": "Hành lý của tôi chưa tới",
          "english": "My bag did not arrive",
          "pronunciation": "han lee koo-ah toy choo toy",
