        }
      ],
      "presentation": "phrase-list"
    },
    {
      "id": "when-to-use",
      "title": "When to use it",
      "body": "Use it after waiting at the carousel and before starting a long explanation. The phrase is strongest when the missing bag and the baggage tag are both easy to see. It also works at an airline baggage counter if staff have already moved you away from the carousel.",
